# hover-hand: the pointer sweeps back and forth across your hand, one move every
# 100 ms, for 20 seconds, while a recording plays. The project's owner reproduced dropped
# frames this way by hand in the prototype's window. Written for a 1600 by 900 window, the
# app's size, where the hand spans x 412 to 1190 at y 736 to 960 in verbs-zones.
#
# Run: just client app --drive hover-hand --fixture verbs-zones --for 20s
